<title>CANADA: Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to July 20.</title>
<headline>Alberta Agriculture details crop growth to July 20.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of crop growth to Sunday.</p>
<p>CROP   TILLERED/ 5-YR AVG SHOTBLADE/ 5-YR AVG HEADED/ 5-YR AVG</p>
<p>	 ROSETTE		FLOWERING	     PODDED</p>
<p>S.Wheat   1 pct    4 pct    20 pct    27 pct   79 pct  69 pct</p>
<p>Oats	6 pct   11 pct    38 pct    42 pct   56 pct  47 pct</p>
<p>Barley    5 pct    8 pct    31 pct    33 pct   64 pct  59 pct</p>
<p>W.Wheat   -	  -	   -	   -	100 pct 100 pct</p>
<p>Fall Rye  -	  -	   -	   -	100 pct 100 pct</p>
<p>Peas	7 pct    -	  55 pct    67 pct   38 pct  33 pct</p>
<p>Canola    4 pct    7 pct    57 pct    72 pct   39 pct  19 pct</p>
<p>Flax	4 pct   15 pct    71 pct    78 pct   25 pct   7 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
